    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Sprint reports from PyPy sprints 2003-2010",
      "source_hash": 1642100743929746362,
      "context_hash": 3314855630733664987,
      "translation": "PyPy 스프린트 보고서(2003-2010)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:00:17.419724Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Here are links to sprint reports from various sprints in the PyPy project, an informal summary of features being worked on and the results of that work.",
      "source_hash": 4233736656333216897,
      "context_hash": 17790230576894333786,
      "translation": "다음은 PyPy 프로젝트의 여러 스프린트에서 작성된 스프린트 보고서 링크입니다. 작업 중인 기능과 그 결과를 비공식적으로 요약한 자료입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:00:25.434240Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A good summary of the progress over the years.....enjoy!",
      "source_hash": 12077572364276668036,
      "context_hash": 7792858171171880196,
      "translation": "수년간의 진행 상황을 잘 정리한 자료입니다.....즐겁게 읽으십시오!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:00:25.434242Z",
      "issues": [
        "The meaning is correct, but \"즐겁게 읽으십시오!\" is stiff and too formal for the casual source; \"즐겁게 보세요!\" would read more naturally, and the \".....\" is carried over from the English rather than adapted."
      ]
    },
