    {
      "id": "section:0/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "`Hildesheim (Feb 2007)`_ (also `EU report writing sprint`_)",
      "source_hash": 9951291706275860728,
      "context_hash": 15163338383273438317,
      "translation": "`Hildesheim (Feb 2007)`_ (`EU report writing sprint`_\\ 도 참고하십시오)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T06:00:56.181677Z",
      "issues": [
        "The reST markup is correct, but \"도 참고하십시오\" means \"see also,\" which reads the source's \"also\" as a cross-reference. The source more likely means the Hildesheim sprint was also the EU report writing sprint, so something like \"(`EU report writing sprint`_\\ 도 겸함)\" would be more accurate and less formal for a short list entry."
      ]
